# Version 1.15's follow-up rounds, round 1 of 2, on Phastform, on a fresh sample of the agents (seed 36): voice
# alone with two and four callers, for each count's SLO, and the configuration the rounds measured, the same with the
# agents' decodes held from a call's first 48 tokens (the opt-*-hold arms), and that with speculative decoding too
# (the opt-*-spec arms), beside 24 agent sessions of the discriminating scenario with 2 and 4 callers.
#   FLATSHARE_GPU=NODE benchmarks/e2/campaign.sh --pause benchmarks/e2/opt-s1.campaign

agents-seed 36

# engine frozen (voice alone)
arms/w5-a1-voice.toml
arms/w5-a1-voice-c4.toml

# engine make-room, the program's optimizations; then the decode hold; then speculative decoding too
arms/opt-disc-ret-s24.toml
arms/opt-disc-ret-c4-s24.toml
arms/opt-disc-hold-s24.toml
arms/opt-disc-hold-c4-s24.toml
arms/opt-disc-spec-s24.toml
arms/opt-disc-spec-c4-s24.toml
